      "line": 24,
      "start": 227,
      "end": 244,
      "source_quote": "鄧粲晉紀曰：「王湛字處沖，太原人。",
      "note": "劉注明引鄧粲《晉紀》，此句屬引書。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 269,
      "end": 282,
      "source_quote": "昶喪，居墓次，兄子濟往省湛",
      "note": "鄧粲晉紀明喪父昶，並稱兄子濟。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 313,
      "end": 323,
      "source_quote": "體中佳時，脫復看耳。",
      "note": "注引鄧粲作「佳時」，唐修晉書作「不佳時」。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 521,
      "end": 533,
      "source_quote": "渾問其故？濟具嘆述如此。",
      "note": "正文中濟所告者是王渾。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 635,
      "end": 647,
      "source_quote": "晉陽秋曰：「濟有人倫鑒識",
      "note": "劉注別引《晉陽秋》。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 695,
      "end": 705,
      "source_quote": "欲以我處季孟之間乎？",
      "note": "《晉陽秋》引語。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
